n false\"></i> Buy server</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"main content grid layout\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"left column with server details\">\n<section class=\"console\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"active server console card\">\n<div class=\"cns-top\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"console header with host and status\">\n<div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"host information group\">\n<div class=\"host\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hostname display with copy button\">\n<span class=\"nm\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"hostname monospace text\">dal-att-04.primevpsbd.com</span>\n<i class=\"icon-copy cp\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"copy to clipboard icon\"></i>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cns-meta mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"server plan and location metadata\">Pro Survey VPS · AT&amp;T residential · Dallas, TX</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"pwr\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"server running status pill\"><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"status dot indicator\"></span>Running</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cns-fields\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"server details fields grid\">\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"IPv4 field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"IPv4 field label\">IPv4</label><div class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"IPv4 value display\">108.204.142.88</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"carrier field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"carrier field label\">Carrier</label><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"carrier value with ASN\">AT&amp;T Services <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"ASN number monospace\" style=\"color:#7f93b3\">AS7018</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"operating system field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"operating system field label\">Operating system</label><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"operating system value\">Windows 10 Pro</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"connection field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"connection field label\">Connection</label><div class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"RDP connection value\">RDP 3389</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"IPQS score field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"IPQS score field label\">IPQS score</label><div class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"IPQS score value\"><span class=\"ok\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"IPQS score numeric value\">0</span> / 100</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-6\" data-name=\"uplink field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"uplink field label\">Uplink</label><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"uplink speed value\">1 Gbps, unmetered</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-7\" data-name=\"hardware field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"hardware field label\">Hardware</label><div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-7-2\" data-name=\"hardware specs value\">4 vCPU, 6 GB, 60 GB NVMe</div></div>\n<div class=\"f\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-8\" data-name=\"renewal date field container\"><label data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-8-1\" data-name=\"renewal field label\">Renews</label><div class=\"v mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2-8-2\" data-name=\"renewal date value\">30 Nov 2026</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cns-actions\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"console action buttons row\">\n<button class=\"b-dark\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"open console primary dark button\"><i class=\"icon-terminal\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"terminal icon\"></i> Open console</button>\n<button class=\"b-ghost\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"restart server ghost button\"><i class=\"icon-power\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"power icon\"></i> Restart</button>\n<button class=\"b-ghost\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"download connection file button\"><i class=\"icon-download\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"download icon\"></i> Connection file</button>\n<span class=\"spacer\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"uptime since date text\">up since 04 Nov 2026</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"ops\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"operational status rows panel\">\n<div class=\"op\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"IP health status row\">\n<div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"IP health row label\"><i class=\"icon-shield-check\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\"></i> IP health</div>\n<div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"IP health row values\"><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"IPQS score description\">IPQS 0 of 100</span><span class=\"tag ok\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"clean status tag\">Clean</span><span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"check timestamp text\">checked 12:41 today</span></div>\n<a class=\"a\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"run check action link\">Run check <i class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"op\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"IP replacement window row\">\n<div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"replacement window row label\"><i class=\"icon-refresh-cw\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"refresh cycle icon\"></i> Replacement window</div>\n<div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"replacement window values\"><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"swap window deadline text\">Open until 22 Nov 2026</span><span class=\"tag neu\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"remaining swaps count tag\">1 swap remaining</span></div>\n<a class=\"a\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"request IP swap action link\">Request IP swap <i class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"op\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"latest job status row\">\n<div class=\"k\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"latest job row label\"><i class=\"icon-database\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"database icon\"></i> Latest job</div>\n<div class=\"v\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"latest job values\"><span data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"job completion status text\">Provisioning completed</span><span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"job completion timestamp\">17 Nov, 12:04 · 68 s</span></div>\n<a class=\"a\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"view job log action link\">View log <i class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"all services table panel\">\n<div class=\"panel-hd\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"panel header with title and sort\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"panel title with count\">All services <span class=\"n\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"services count numeral\">3</span></h2>\n<a data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"sort by renewal dropdown trigger\">Sort by renewal <i class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"chevron down icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n<table data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"services data table\">\n<thead data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"table header row\">\n<tr data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"header cells row\">\n<th data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service column header\" style=